\u2026<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Getting trapped in a souffle<br></li><li>Meeting strange creatures in a painting<br></li><li>Receiving career advice from your B.F.G.<br></li><li>Solving puzzles because puzzles are fun</li></ul><br>And more! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950850/extras/63016309652e8d6e07cdaeb6abac873c.avif?t=1670017377\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950850/extras/90d65944a89a8c2ef4783211c5127ba1.avif?t=1670017377\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950850/extras/8a679af53a00c568233dc7e0d47e35b0.poster.avif?t=1670017377\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950850/extras/8a679af53a00c568233dc7e0d47e35b0.webm?t=1670017377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/950850/extras/8a679af53a00c568233dc7e0d47e35b0.mp4?t=1670017377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
